---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout
  title="Krishna Teja Gummadi — Technical Architect"
  description="Technical Architect with 17+ years architecting enterprise healthcare platforms and applied AI/GenAI solutions on Azure, AWS, and OCI."
>
<header class="nav" id="nav">
  <div class="nav-inner">
    <a href="#top" class="logo">KTG<span class="dot">.</span></a>
    <nav class="nav-links">
      <a href="#about">About</a>
      <a href="#skills">Skills</a>
      <a href="#experience">Experience</a>
      <a href="#certs">Certifications</a>
      <a href="#contact">Contact</a>
    </nav>
    <a href="#contact" class="nav-cta">Get in touch</a>
    <button class="nav-toggle" id="navToggle" aria-label="Toggle menu">
      <span></span><span></span><span></span>
    </button>
  </div>
</header>

<main>
  <!-- HERO -->
  <section class="hero" id="top">
    <div class="hero-inner">
      <h1>Krishna Teja Gummadi</h1>
      <p class="role">Technical Architect &mdash; Enterprise Healthcare Platforms &amp; Applied AI</p>
      <p class="hero-desc">
        17+ years architecting and delivering mission-critical, enterprise-scale platforms for
        health-plan Claims, Enrollment, and Provider systems &mdash; and, more recently, leading the
        applied AI/GenAI layer on top of them: Azure OpenAI, Azure AI Foundry, Copilot Studio, and
        agentic orchestration for regulated, HIPAA/ACA/CMS-governed environments.
      </p>
      <div class="hero-actions">
        <a href="#experience" class="btn btn-primary">View Experience</a>
        <a href="mailto:krishna.g9090@gmail.com" class="btn btn-ghost">Email Me</a>
      </div>
      <div class="hero-stats">
        <div class="stat"><span class="stat-num">17+</span><span class="stat-label">Years Experience</span></div>
        <div class="stat"><span class="stat-num">12+</span><span class="stat-label">Certifications</span></div>
        <div class="stat"><span class="stat-num">6</span><span class="stat-label">Enterprise Platforms Architected</span></div>
        <div class="stat"><span class="stat-num">3</span><span class="stat-label">Cloud Ecosystems (Azure/AWS/OCI)</span></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ABOUT -->
  <section class="section" id="about">
    <div class="section-inner">
      <p class="section-kicker">01 &mdash; About</p>
      <h2>Architecting systems that carry real weight</h2>
      <div class="about-grid">
        <div class="about-text">
          <p>
            I'm a Technical Architect specializing in large-scale healthcare platforms &mdash;
            Claims, Enrollment, and Provider systems built on Facets and MetaVance &mdash; for
            national health plans operating under HIPAA, ACA, and CMS regulation. I translate
            dense regulatory and business requirements into technical architectures that are
            scalable, auditable, and built to survive contact with production.
          </p>
          <p>
            Over the last several years I've extended that architecture practice into applied
            AI: designing and governing Azure OpenAI and Azure AI Foundry solutions, conversational
            agents in Copilot Studio, and enterprise rollouts of Microsoft 365 Copilot and GitHub
            Copilot &mdash; always with responsible-AI guardrails, audit trails, and explainability
            built in from day one, not bolted on after.
          </p>
          <p>
            I work comfortably across the full stack: UML-driven system design in Visio,
            full-stack JEE and modern web development, deep RDBMS and performance tuning, and
            orchestration platforms like Camunda 8 for durable, resumable workflow state. I've led
            architecture review boards, mentored delivery teams, and served as trusted advisor to
            senior stakeholders on budgeting, risk, and release planning.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="about-highlights">
          <div class="highlight-card">
            <h3>Domains</h3>
            <p>Healthcare Payer Systems &middot; Claims &amp; Adjudication &middot; Enrollment &amp; Membership &middot; Prior Authorization &middot; Provider Compliance</p>
          </div>
          <div class="highlight-card">
            <h3>AI / GenAI Focus</h3>
            <p>Azure OpenAI &middot; Azure AI Foundry &middot; Copilot Studio &middot; Responsible AI Guardrails &middot; Agentic Orchestration</p>
          </div>
          <div class="highlight-card">
            <h3>Governance</h3>
            <p>HIPAA &middot; ACA &middot; CMS &middot; TOGAF Enterprise Architecture &middot; Architecture Review Boards</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- SKILLS -->
  <section class="section section-alt" id="skills">
    <div class="section-inner">
      <p class="section-kicker">02 &mdash; Skills &amp; Technology</p>
      <h2>Technical toolkit</h2>
      <div class="skills-grid">

        <div class="skill-card">
          <div class="skill-icon">✨</div>
          <h3>AI &amp; GenAI</h3>
          <div class="tags">
            <span>Azure OpenAI (GPT-4/4o)</span><span>Azure AI Foundry</span><span>Azure Document Intelligence</span>
            <span>Azure Cognitive Services</span><span>Copilot Studio</span><span>Microsoft 365 Copilot</span>
            <span>GitHub Copilot</span><span>Power Automate</span><span>Amazon Textract</span>
            <span>Amazon Forecast</span><span>OCI Generative AI</span>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="skill-card">
          <div class="skill-icon">☁</div>
          <h3>Cloud &amp; Platforms</h3>
          <div class="tags">
            <span>Microsoft Azure</span><span>AWS (EC2, S3, RDS, ELB)</span><span>Oracle Cloud Infrastructure</span>
            <span>Docker</span><span>Kubernetes</span><span>OpenShift</span>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="skill-card">
          <div class="skill-icon">{ }</div>
          <h3>Languages &amp; Frameworks</h3>
          <div class="tags">
            <span>Java / J2EE</span><span>Spring / Spring Boot</span><span>Spring Batch</span><span>Hibernate / JPA</span>
            <span>Struts</span><span>JSF</span><span>Node.js</span><span>AngularJS</span><span>Python</span>
            <span>C / C++</span><span>SOAP / REST</span>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="skill-card">
          <div class="skill-icon">⛁</div>
          <h3>Data &amp; Databases</h3>
          <div class="tags">
            <span>Oracle 10g</span><span>SQL Server</span><span>MySQL</span><span>Sybase</span>
            <span>DB2</span><span>PL/SQL</span><span>PostgreSQL</span><span>Azure Data Lake</span>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="skill-card">
          <div class="skill-icon">✚</div>
          <h3>Healthcare Platforms</h3>
          <div class="tags">
            <span>Facets 4.81 (Claims, Enrollment)</span><span>MetaVance</span><span>EDI 834 / 278 / 279</span>
            <span>Facets FXI / ISL Web Services</span>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="skill-card">
          <div class="skill-icon">⚑</div>
          <h3>Orchestration &amp; Architecture</h3>
          <div class="tags">
            <span>Camunda 8 / DMN</span><span>UML (Visio)</span><span>TOGAF EA</span>
            <span>Event-driven / Middleware Design</span><span>ServiceNow Integration</span>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="skill-card">
          <div class="skill-icon">⚙</div>
          <h3>DevOps &amp; Tools</h3>
          <div class="tags">
            <span>Git</span><span>SVN</span><span>CodeCommit</span><span>Jenkins</span><span>Maven / Ant</span>
            <span>JIRA</span><span>Dynatrace</span><span>Splunk</span><span>JUnit</span>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="skill-card">
          <div class="skill-icon">▦</div>
          <h3>Methodology</h3>
          <div class="tags">
            <span>Agile / Scrum</span><span>Waterfall</span><span>Test-Driven Development</span>
            <span>Risk &amp; Release Planning</span><span>Architecture Governance</span>
          </div>
        </div>

      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- EXPERIENCE -->
  <section class="section" id="experience">
    <div class="section-inner">
      <p class="section-kicker">03 &mdash; Experience</p>
      <h2>Where I've built</h2>
      <p class="section-sub">17+ years at Tata Consultancy Services (TCS), architecting systems for Fortune 100
        health plans and a global automotive manufacturer. Engagement names are generalized below.</p>

      <div class="timeline">

        <div class="tl-item">
          <div class="tl-marker"></div>
          <div class="tl-content">
            <span class="tl-date">Jul 2020 &ndash; Present</span>
            <h3>Technical Architect</h3>
            <p class="tl-org">Fortune 100 Healthcare Payer &middot; Northern California</p>
            <p>
              Architect of record for 24x7 mission-critical hospital-operations applications. Led custom
              development and integration of Azure OpenAI (GPT-4/4o) and Azure AI Foundry for intelligent
              document and claims-processing automation, plus Azure Document Intelligence for structured
              extraction from healthcare forms. Designed conversational AI assistants in Copilot Studio
              integrated with Power Automate, and drove enterprise adoption of Microsoft 365 Copilot and
              GitHub Copilot. Also architected an orchestration platform (Decision Layer, Orchestrator, State
              Manager) automating security-vulnerability remediation with a rule-based engine and
              human-in-the-loop fallback, and authored an architecture-board&ndash;reviewed solution design
              evaluating Camunda 8, Temporal, and Azure Durable Functions for a durable workflow orchestration
              layer.
            </p>
            <div class="tl-tags">
              <span>Azure OpenAI</span><span>Copilot Studio</span><span>Camunda 8</span><span>Spring Boot</span><span>Dynatrace</span><span>ServiceNow</span>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="tl-item">
          <div class="tl-marker"></div>
          <div class="tl-content">
            <span class="tl-date">Jul 2018 &ndash; Jun 2020</span>
            <h3>Technical Architect</h3>
            <p class="tl-org">National Health Insurance Provider</p>
            <p>
              Designed and delivered an EDI 278 (Health Care Services Review) integration on the MetaVance
              platform, validating prior-authorization requirements against benefit-plan and medical-necessity
              rules ahead of adjudication &mdash; reducing downstream claim denials. Architected a Provider
              Handbook Validation API as a real-time REST service layer, replacing manual credentialing and
              fee-schedule lookups with automated compliance checks integrated into claims workflows.
            </p>
            <div class="tl-tags">
              <span>MetaVance</span><span>EDI 278/279</span><span>Java / Spring Boot</span><span>REST</span>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="tl-item">
          <div class="tl-marker"></div>
          <div class="tl-content">
            <span class="tl-date">Jan 2014 &ndash; Jun 2018</span>
            <h3>Technical Lead / Architect</h3>
            <p class="tl-org">Regional Health Plan &middot; Pacific Northwest</p>
            <p>
              Led an AWS-based enterprise content-management migration, architecting communication tracking,
              process logging, and file reconciliation components with 150% ROI in three months post go-live.
              Designed "Direct to Facets," an automated claims-disposition engine using Facets ISL/FXI web
              services that raised auto-adjudication rates from 73% to 94%. Architected the Enrollment data
              pipeline processing EDI 834 transactions, cutting manual intervention from 23% to 5%.
            </p>
            <div class="tl-tags">
              <span>AWS</span><span>Facets 4.81</span><span>EDI 834</span><span>Spring Batch</span><span>Python</span>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="tl-item">
          <div class="tl-marker"></div>
          <div class="tl-content">
            <span class="tl-date">Feb 2010 &ndash; Dec 2013</span>
            <h3>J2EE Development Lead</h3>
            <p class="tl-org">Global Automotive Manufacturer &middot; International Business Unit</p>
            <p>
              Delivered and progressively led four enterprise J2EE applications, including a 45+ app web
              portal, international wholesale &amp; inventory tracking, export-compliance certification, and a
              digital asset management system &mdash; built on Java/J2EE, Spring, Struts, and Hibernate,
              deployed on IBM WebSphere.
            </p>
            <div class="tl-tags">
              <span>J2EE</span><span>Struts</span><span>Hibernate</span><span>WebSphere</span>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="tl-item">
          <div class="tl-marker"></div>
          <div class="tl-content">
            <span class="tl-date">Dec 2008 &ndash; Jan 2010</span>
            <h3>J2EE Developer</h3>
            <p class="tl-org">TCS Internal Projects</p>
            <p>Built a Contact Management Tool (JSP, Servlets, JDBC, Oracle) for internal marketing and operations teams &mdash; the start of a 17-year run at TCS.</p>
            <div class="tl-tags"><span>JSP</span><span>Servlets</span><span>Oracle</span></div>
          </div>
        </div>

      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- CERTIFICATIONS -->
  <section class="section section-alt" id="certs">
    <div class="section-inner">
      <p class="section-kicker">04 &mdash; Certifications &amp; Recognition</p>
      <h2>Credentials</h2>
      <div class="cert-grid">
        <div class="cert-chip">TOGAF® Enterprise Architecture Practitioner</div>
        <div class="cert-chip">Microsoft Certified: Azure Solutions Architect Expert</div>
        <div class="cert-chip">Microsoft Certified: Azure AI Engineer Associate</div>
        <div class="cert-chip">Microsoft Certified: Azure Administrator Associate</div>
        <div class="cert-chip">Microsoft Certified: Azure AI Fundamentals</div>
        <div class="cert-chip">AWS Certified AI Practitioner</div>
        <div class="cert-chip">AWS Certified Developer &ndash; Associate</div>
        <div class="cert-chip">Oracle Cloud Infrastructure 2025 Generative AI Professional</div>
        <div class="cert-chip">Sun Certified Java Programmer</div>
        <div class="cert-chip">Professional, Academy for Healthcare Management (PAHM)</div>
        <div class="cert-chip">TCS Certified Architecture &amp; Tools: Technical Architect</div>
        <div class="cert-chip">TCS Certified Digital: Java Full Stack with Angular</div>
      </div>

      <div class="cert-links">
        <a href="https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/users/krishnatejagummadi-5466/transcript/dr9jma8xk468w5g?tab=credentials-tab" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Microsoft Learn Profile &rarr;</a>
        <a href="https://www.credly.com/users/kt-gummadi/badges" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Credly Badges &rarr;</a>
      </div>

      <h3 class="awards-title">Awards</h3>
      <ul class="awards-list">
        <li>Highest performance rating (Band A) &mdash; 3 consecutive years, plus multiple Star of the Month and On-the-Spot awards</li>
        <li>Impact Award &mdash; Q4 2021, healthcare payer leadership</li>
        <li>Appreciation Award &mdash; Q4 2016, regional health plan leadership</li>
        <li>Spotlight Award (x3) &mdash; 2012&ndash;2013, automotive manufacturer leadership</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- CONTACT -->
  <section class="section contact-section" id="contact">
    <div class="section-inner">
      <p class="section-kicker">05 &mdash; Contact</p>
      <h2>Let's build something reliable</h2>
      <div class="contact-grid">
        <a class="contact-card" href="https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/users/krishnatejagummadi-5466/transcript/dr9jma8xk468w5g?tab=credentials-tab" target="_blank" rel="noopener">
          <span class="contact-label">Microsoft Learn</span>
          <span class="contact-value">View Transcript &rarr;</span>
        </a>
        <a class="contact-card" href="https://www.credly.com/users/kt-gummadi/badges" target="_blank" rel="noopener">
          <span class="contact-label">Credly</span>
          <span class="contact-value">View Badges &rarr;</span>
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</main>

<footer class="footer">
  <p>&copy; <span id="year"></span> Krishna Teja Gummadi &middot; Technical Architect</p>
</footer>
</Layout>
